OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners mark 20 years of being
OL,4,AFairtrade island
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners are celebrating 20 years of
OL,7,FGuernsey being a Fairtrade island,
OL,8,Fsaying everyday shopping choices can
OL,9,Fcontinue to improve the lives of
OL,10,Fproducers around the world.
OL,12,FThe Fairtrade scheme aims to ensure
OL,13,Ffarmers and workers receive fairer
OL,14,Fprices and working conditions for
OL,15,Fproducing goods such as coffee,
OL,16,Fchocolate and bananas.
OL,18,FThe island received the status in 2006
OL,19,Fin recognition of its commitment to
OL,20,FFairtrade products, which are now used
OL,21,Facross the hospital, prison and a
OL,22,Fnumber of schools.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
