OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners mark 20 years of being
OL,4,AFairtrade island
OL,5,
OL,6,FFairtrade Guernsey Steering Group is
OL,7,Fhosting a series of community events to
OL,8,Fmark the anniversary, with member Steve
OL,9,FMauger praising the "very, very good"
OL,10,Fsupport from island businesses over 20
OL,11,Fyears.
